<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven stocks fell, four rose and four were flat in 10.4-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,596.2 points, 0.5 percent higher than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining eight stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units were flat in 7.8-million-zloty constinuous trade.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
